{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#card-zh","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet 是面向 DSH Web 的会话观察挂件，会固定显示在界面浮层中。宿主监听顶层会话，在真人消息后按设定轮数读取近期对话和工具结果，调用当前模型先整理可核对的问题并生成修正提示，再用设定口吻转述；也可以从面板手动发起观察。它会将提醒显示在气泡和历史面板中，并提供复制修正提示的按钮，挂件位置可拖动并记住。适合希望检查助手承诺是否有会话证据、并快速把跟进要求带回对话的人。需要宿主提供 sessionQuery 和 llm 服务及可用模型；没有检测到额外的 API Key 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-250","lib/index.js:345-363","lib/index.js:497-510","client/client.js:297-320","client/client.js:372-390","client/client.js:524-536"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#card-en","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pet is a floating DSH Web widget that reviews recent session messages and tool results. It can run after a set number of human-driven turns or on demand, then shows a corrective prompt for copying. It needs host sessionQuery and llm services and an available model.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-250","lib/index.js:345-363","lib/index.js:497-510","client/client.js:297-320","client/client.js:372-390","client/client.js:524-536"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#intent-1","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"想让 DSH 定期检查助手说完成的事情有没有对话证据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-250","lib/index.js:497-510"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#intent-2","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"能不能根据工具返回内容帮我整理一段让助手继续核对的提示？","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:245-263","lib/index.js:340-363"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#intent-3","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"我希望在会话里手动点一下，就让模型回看这段协作过程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:587-605","client/client.js:297-319"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#intent-4","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 里有没有能悬浮显示提醒、还能复制跟进要求的小挂件？","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:297-320","client/client.js:444-474","client/client.js:524-536"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#intent-5","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"I want a session companion that checks an assistant's claims against recorded tool results and drafts a follow-up prompt.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-263","lib/index.js:340-363"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#intent-6","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Can I trigger a review of my current DSH conversation and copy the suggested correction back into it?","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:587-605","client/client.js:297-320"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#feature-1","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet 的功能「定期观察会话」：宿主订阅会话事件，只统计收到真人消息的顶层会话；每完成设定轮数后触发观察。观察会读取近期消息和工具结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-263","lib/index.js:497-510"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#feature-2","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet 的功能「生成修正提示」：自动触发或从面板手动发起观察后，模型分两步生成内容：先根据会话转写写出修正提示，再整理成简短转述。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:340-363","lib/index.js:587-605"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#feature-3","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet 的功能「面板与气泡提醒」：客户端轮询宿主的观察记录，将新结果显示在浮动气泡和可展开的历史面板里，并提供复制修正提示的按钮。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:270-295","client/client.js:419-474"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#feature-4","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet 的功能「拖动挂件」：用户可在页面上拖动鲸鱼挂件调整位置；松开后将坐标存入浏览器 localStorage，下次加载时恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:218-226","client/client.js:372-390"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#caveat-1","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet 使用前须知：会话读取和模型生成依赖宿主提供 sessionQuery 与 llm 服务，并需要可用的 provider/model；缺少任一服务时观察会失败。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:345-363","lib/index.js:237-242"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#intent-7","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"助手说已经验证了，我想让工具记录也一起纳入回看。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:245-263","lib/index.js:340-363"]}
{"unit_id":"ALKAERR__dsh-pet#intent-8","repo":"ALKAERR/dsh-pet","commit":"5d9c53557ccf4354a4337c5dd449029514d028a3","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Show me a small draggable widget in the web app where I can review recent reminders and copy a suggested fix.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:372-390","client/client.js:419-474"]}
